[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Community[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m[moodle.org][1] is the central hub for the Moodle Community, with spaces for educators, administrators and developers to meet and work together.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mYou may also be interested in:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- attending a [Moodle Moot][6][m
[32m+[m[32m- our regular series of [developer meetings][7][m
[32m+[m[32m- the [Moodle User Association][8][m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Installation and hosting[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMoodle is Free, and Open Source software. You can easily [download Moodle][9] and run it on your own web server, however you may prefer to work with one of our experienced [Moodle Partners][10].[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMoodle also offers hosting through both [MoodleCloud][11], and our [partner network][10].[m
